        <div class="about-intro">
            <div class="prose fade-in">
                <p>Elephas Consultancy was founded by <strong>Leonard Hulley</strong>, an engineer with long experience of building and delivering business-critical systems in both the UK and Sweden — from bespoke business systems and integrations to project delivery and technical assurance on larger programmes.</p>
                <p>When you hire Elephas, you talk directly to the person who builds. No sales layer, no juniors learning at your expense, no handovers where details go missing. What we do have is modern AI tooling that gives a single senior engineer the capacity of a full team — <a href="/en/how-we-work/">read how that works</a>.</p>
                <p>The name? The elephant stands for memory, strength and patience — qualities we think belong in good software and long client relationships.</p>
            </div>
